      "role": "user",
      "content": "those are okay starts but they're a bit short. can you actually write the full monologues? like, a good 2-3 paragraphs each. \n\ni really want to feel the difference in how they think. make the traditionalist's speech feel really measured and thoughtful, like they're talking about real-world consequences. and for the progressive, make it feel more high-energy and urgent, like they're driven by a sense of justice.",
